Source license notes
--------------------

The FxFloorBoard source files carry GPL version 2 or later headers and the archive ships the
GPL version 3 text as license.txt. midi.xml itself carries an "All rights reserved" line without
an explicit license of its own; it is treated as part of the GPL-licensed program. The derived
data in this crate is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later together with the rest of Katana Control.
Residual risk: should the copyright holder consider midi.xml separately licensed, the derived
table would have to be replaced with independently researched data.

Changes made to the derived data
--------------------------------

* Addresses, sizes, ranges and labels were converted into a flat JSON table (699 parameters).
* patch_size corrected from 3912 to 1992 (RQ1 size 00 00 0F 48, as measured on the amp).
* The variant_select_values table was removed; type/variant linkage lives in katana-protocol.
* Each entry is tagged "research" ([R], taken from FxFloorBoard) unless it was verified on a real
  Katana 50 MK II ([V], with the verification date).
